    "MS"
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "The theory offers a theory of the mind at the level of lived (mental) experience and does not offer a general theory of the brain, though it builds by reference to brain science.",
    "This work is presented as a 'beginning, not an end,' for a larger project to develop a new, useful Science of ourselves and our interaction with the world."
  ],
